## Phase 7: Observability Foundation
**Goal:** Full request tracing, metrics, and health checks.

### 7.1 Create `instrumentation.ts`
- [ ] Wire structured logs through existing logger
- [ ] Every request carries: requestId, userId (when available), route, cache key, cache layer, dependency timings

### 7.2 Emit metrics
- [ ] `http_request_duration_ms` (per route)
- [ ] `db_query_duration_ms` (per query/operation)
- [ ] `cache_hit_total`, `cache_miss_total`, `cache_refresh_total`, `cache_stale_served_total`, `cache_fallback_total`
- [ ] `rate_limit_rejected_total`
- [ ] Redis health/utilization
- [ ] Prisma middleware for automatic query timing

### 7.3 Health endpoints
- [ ] `/api/health` — liveness (already exists, enhance with dependency checks)
- [ ] `/api/ready` — readiness with dependency snapshot
  - Redis-down → ready-but-degraded
  - DB/auth failure → not ready
- [ ] Add Redis, Supabase Auth, Whop API reachability checks to health

### Verification
- [ ] Metrics visible in structured logs
- [ ] `/api/ready` returns correct degraded/not-ready states
- [ ] Health endpoint covers all critical dependencies

